{"about_the_game":"<u><strong>Enhance your Windows experience with Containers</strong></u><br><br>Containers allows the storage of your files and folders in boxes called <strong>\u201cContainer\u201d</strong>, these boxes can be accessed at any time on your desktop or called thanks to built-in shortcuts or with the help of the <strong>\u201cContainers Tab\u201d</strong> menu.<br><br><strong><u>Containers</u></strong><br>Containers are sticked to your desktop when you don't use them.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989710/extras/c9991a7e066b24a3161cd8cf2a674013.avif?t=1678104038\" width=438 height=209 /></span><br><br><strong><u>Mirror Containers</u></strong><br>\u201cMirror\u201d Containers are representations of files and folders in a selected folder on your computer.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989710/extras/684741bb47e6592c577a4f97913da07e.avif?t=1678104038\" width=557 height=243 /></span><br><br><strong><u>Container Customization</u></strong><br>Containers can have different colored backgrounds or a background with an image.<br>You can also set the transparency method of your Containers.<br><br>If you are on Windows 11 you can also choose between Containers with rounded or squared edges.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989710/extras/6afeb711456298d139633b60cd69e7aa.avif?t=1678104038\" width=437 height=187 /></span><br><br><strong><u>Containers Tab Menu</u></strong><br>The Containers Tab menu allows you to call the Container of your choice without leaving the application in the foreground, it works similarly to the Alt-Tab menu in Windows.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989710/extras/4e401c4bc6496fa6a7efc7f617df167c.avif?t=1678104038\" width=522 height=189 /></span><br><br><strong><u>Closing Containers</u></strong><br>Containers can be independently closed manually or automatically to save space.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989710/extras/13cf6c9c2cd969444dac2a94756a1424.webp?t=1678104038\" width=435 height=47 /></span><br><br><strong><u>Sorting Containers content</u></strong><br>You can independently sort the contents of your Containers according to your choice.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989710/extras/0b3480c4faaaeced62eb95b8f64e5054.avif?t=1678104038\" width=145 height=209 /></span><br><br><strong><u>Container content size</u></strong><br>You can change the size of your Container icons at any time.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989710/extras/6afeb711456298d139633b60cd69e7aa.avif?t=1678104038\" width=437 height=187 /></span><br><br><strong><u>Shortcuts</u></strong><br>The Containers application has shortcuts to help you manipulate your Containers, each shortcut can be modified and disabled.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Colorful","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1989710/484cf281e03cfb6d5f38ecc77c78e2fbbdbc970d.jpg"},{"name":"1 + 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1989710/7a389ad5ead5cd8b1d17b9e371487037689a9de0.jpg"},{"name":"Containers Tab Menu","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1989710/86e86ffb7c8a778e45e2ad41e02110ac5fdb7fa0.jpg"}],"total":3},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1989710?t=1678104038","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/s